<title>UK: T&amp;N declares interim dividend of 3.0p/shr.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N declares interim dividend of 3.0p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>T&amp;N Plc confirmed it will pay a special 1997 interim dividend of 3.0 pence per share, on July 11.</p>
<p>This dividend, as originally stated by the company last month, when it released its 1996 results, is in lieu of the 1996 final dividend and is scheduled to be paid on July 11, T&amp;N said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
